      "description": "YOUR MAIN QUEST, ALWAYS IN SIGHT\n\nQuestBar lives in your menubar, keeping your current focus visible at all times. No more losing track of what you're working on. Your active quest is one glance away.\n\nRPG-style task tracking:\n\n• Add new quests with optional descriptions.\n• Set your focus with your active quest shown right in the menubar.\n• Vanquish completed tasks with satisfaction.\n• Resurrect quests if needed.\n• Burn vanquished quests to clear your finished tasks in a blaze of glory.\n\nSimple & Lightweight:\n\n• Lives in a widget\n• Data stored locally in a simple JSON file\n• Add descriptions for extra context (descriptions unavailable on watchOS)\n\nYour data, wholly yours:\n\nQuests are stored on your device, and sync privately through your own iCloud. You can add, edit, remove, and sync directly from the app.\n\nPerfect for those with a wandering mind that need a little help staying on track.\n\nStay focused. Vanquish your quests. Be the hero of your own productivity story.",
